---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga"
  description="Terms and conditions for Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga. Learn about our use of website, service disclaimers, liability limitations, and privacy practices."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-[#132043] min-h-[20dvh] flex items-center">
      <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">

        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: May 2025</p>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">1. Use of This Website</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">By accessing and using the Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga website (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use the Site.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">This Site is intended for informational purposes and to facilitate contact between homeowners and our service team. You may not use the Site for any unlawful purpose or in any way that could damage, disable, or impair the Site or interfere with any other party's use of the Site.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">2. Services Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The information on this Site is provided for general informational purposes only. It is not a substitute for a professional on-site inspection and assessment. All service recommendations, cost estimates, and timelines are subject to change based on actual site conditions.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga makes no guarantee that information on this Site is complete, accurate, or current. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any service at any time without notice.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">To the fullest extent permitted by law, Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga and its employees, officers, and agents shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of your use of (or inability to use) this Site or any services described herein.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Our total liability in connection with any claim arising out of or relating to these Terms or your use of the Site shall not exceed the amount you paid us, if any, in the six months preceding the claim.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">All content on this Site — including text, images, logos, and design elements — is the property of Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from any content on this Site without our express written permission.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">5. Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">When you submit a contact form on this Site, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and any project details you provide. This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and provide the services you've requested.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. We take reasonable steps to protect your information from unauthorized access or disclosure. For questions about our data practices, contact us at the information below.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">This Site may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only. We have no control over the content or practices of those sites and accept no responsibility for them. Visiting any third-party site is at your own risk.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of the Site following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">8. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Tennessee, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising under these terms shall be resolved in the appropriate courts located in Hamilton County, Tennessee.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-4">9. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-[#132043]">Basement Waterproofing Chattanooga</strong><br />
          Phone: <a href="tel:8653702211" class="text-[#2563eb] hover:underline">(865) 370-2211</a><br />
          Chattanooga, TN</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
